# Build artefacts
ppg_analysis
ppg_analysis_asan
ppg_analysis_debug
*.o
# The same binaries as a Windows build names them.  A Windows `make` leaves an
# executable next to every target here, and an untracked binary in the tree is
# easy to commit by accident -- so they are ignored as a class.  The released
# engine is the ONE exception, committed deliberately so the monitor can be run
# on Windows without a compiler; the negation must follow the pattern it
# overrides, or it has no effect.
*.exe
!ppg_analysis.exe

# Run outputs -- the program writes these into the CURRENT WORKING DIRECTORY.
# Run it from a scratch directory such as run/, not from here.
ppg_analysis.csv
RR_Data.csv
INTP_RR_peak.csv
INTP_RR_foot.csv
INTP_RR_fm.csv
*_ppg_analysis.csv
*_RR_Data.csv

# Local scratch output directories -- never publish these
out/
out1/
out2/
run/

# Python bytecode, in case a helper script is run from the tree
__pycache__/
*.pyc
